{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03997","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 王茂时","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"践胜寻良会，乘春翫物华。\n还随张放友，来向石崇家。\n止水分岩镜，闲庭枕浦沙。\n未极林泉赏，参差落照斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王茂时","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}